FlipV' and 'Transpose' to AtlasTexture.\r\n\r\n* When drawing the region specified by the AtlasTexture, it will be drawn according to the 'FlipH', 'FlipV' and 'Transpose' properties.\r\n\r\nIt is common practice for Atlases to rotate some of their members 90 degrees to better pack them into a square for read effeciency. Because of this some of their members must be transformed back at runtime.\r\n\r\nThis will allow these transformed members to be handled at the texture scope along with the 'region' and 'margin'.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1794\" height=\"1391\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/be32a768-f31e-40a7-8382-26d32f5d7ac3\" />\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11630*\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.",